{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>And you shall count for yourself seven sabbatical years of years, etc.</b> You must not count for the Jubilees lunar years of twelve months each as a simple reckoning; rather, they shall be ordinary and intercalated years according to the ordinance of the Sages, so that they align with forty-nine solar years — as is undoubtedly the case with the Sabbatical year, since it depends on plowing and sowing, as has been explained concerning it."], :book :leviticus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:37:50.628700293Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}